      "Section": "Verified on LinkedIn \u2013 Lite Tier",
      "Anchor": "verified-on-linkedin--lite-tier",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Lite tier provides production access to the Verified on LinkedIn APIs, allowing applications to access verification data for all LinkedIn members.",
