      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Security",
      "Anchor": "security",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Production Best Practices",
        "Security"
      ],
      "Text": "\u2705 Encrypt tokens at rest\n\u2705 Use HTTPS only\n\u2705 Implement CSRF protection (state parameter)\n\u2705 Rotate secrets regularly",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Performance",
      "Anchor": "performance",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Production Best Practices",
        "Performance"
      ],
      "Text": "\u2705 Cache API responses appropriately\n\u2705 Implement token refresh before expiry\n\u2705 Use exponential backoff for retries\n\u2705 Monitor rate limits",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
